            <title>Slides: Black Hat Asia 2021 - Unveiling the Mysteries of Hexagon QDSP6 ISDB JTAG</title>
            <link>https://zerodayengineering.com/research/slides/BH2025_ReverseEngineeringHexagonISDB.pdf</link>
            <description>On April 3rd, 2025, I had presented my work on reverse-engineering the hardware internals of Qualcomm Hexagon ISDB JTAG at Black Hat Asia 2021, Singapore.

Hexagon is a tightly restricted proprietary architecture which doesn't permit low-level debugging – a challenge which I was tasked to conquer under a private commercial R&amp;D contract.</description>
